<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>OTP Verification - Quiz-Blog</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #157A6E, #1e8e85);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 16px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }

        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #157A6E;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        @keyframes shimmer {
            0% { transform: translateX(-100%); }
            100% { transform: translateX(100%); }
        }

        .warning-box {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .warning-text {
            color: #856404;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .info-text {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .links-section {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #e9ecef;
        }

        .links-title {
            color: #157A6E;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .link-item {
            display: block;
            color: #157A6E;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .link-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .link-item:hover {
            color: #0f5d56;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .footer {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef;
        }

        .company-info {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .company-name {
            color: #157A6E;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .company-tagline {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .company-location {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .social-links {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .social-link {
            color: #1f3fcf;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0 8px;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .social-link:hover {
            color: #157A6E;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .separator {
            margin: 0 4px;
            color: #999;
        }

        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .container {
                margin: 10px;
                border-radius: 0;
            }
            
            .content {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
            
            .header {
                padding: 25px 20px;
            }
            
            .footer {
                padding: 25px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>New Quiz Alert</h1>
            <p>A new quiz was created!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <div class="greeting">
                Hi {{name}},
            </div>

            <p>
                A new quiz titled "{{quizTitle}}" has been created.
            </p>
    
            <div class="warning-box">
                <div class="warning-text">Quiz Details</div>
                <div class="info-text">
                    • Quiz Title: {{quizTitle}}<br>
                    • Created By: {{author}}<br>

                    <p>
                        Click this link <a href={{quizLink}}>{{quizTitle}}</a> to take the quiz.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="links-section">
                <div class="links-title">📚 Explore Quiz-Blog</div>
                <a href="https://www.quizblog.rw/about" class="link-item">📖 Learn more about us</a>
                <a href="https://www.quizblog.rw/blog" class="link-item">✍️ Check out our blog</a>
            </div>

            <p style="color: #157A6E; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 30px;">
                Happy quizzing! 🎓
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <div class="company-info">
                <div class="company-name">Quiz-Blog Rwanda</div>
                <div class="company-tagline">Quizzing & Blogging</div>
                <div class="company-location">📍 Kigali | Rwamagana, Rwanda</div>
            </div>

            <div class="social-links">
                <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/quiz-blog/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link">LinkedIn</a>
                <span class="separator">|</span>
                <a href="https://www.facebook.com/QuizblogRw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link">Facebook</a>
                <span class="separator">|</span>
                <a href="https://twitter.com/QuizblogRw" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link">Twitter</a>
                <span class="separator">|</span>
                <a href="https://www.instagram.com/quizblogrw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link">Instagram</a>
                <span class="separator">|</span>
                <a href="https://www.quizblog.rw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link">Website</a>
                <span class="separator">|</span>
                <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=250780579067" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link">📱 WhatsApp</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <hr>
        <small>
            You are receiving this email because you subscribed to Quiz-Blog. <br>
            Click here <a href={{unsubLink}}>Unsubscribe</a>
        </small>
    </div>
</body>

</html>